How to Write Inheritance code Step by Step :

Step 1 — Create Parent Class
class Parent {}

Step 2 — Add Parent Methods
class Parent 
{
    void method1() 
    {
        System.out.println("Parent Method");
    }
}

Step 3 — Create Child Class Using extends
class Child extends Parent {}

Step 4 — Add Child Method
class Child extends Parent 
{
    void method2() 
    {
        System.out.println("Child Method");
    }
}

Step 5 — Create Object in Main Method
Child obj = new Child();

Step 6 — Call Both Methods
obj.method1();
obj.method2();
--> method1() comes from Parent
--> method2() comes from Child

Output :
Parent Method
Child Method

